## Season cadence

- **Season length**: {{SEASON_LENGTH_DAYS}} days (default: 90)
- **Weekly review day**: {{WEEKLY_REVIEW_DAY}} (default: Sunday)
- **Mentor refresh cadence**: every {{MENTOR_REFRESH_WEEKS}} weeks (default: 4)

## Time budget (per active domain)

- **Floor per week**: {{TIME_FLOOR_PER_DOMAIN}} min
